Executive Summary: SWE Week 2025

To: Head, Department of Software Engineering From: Local Organizing Committee (L.O.C) Date: September 2025

Overview

SWE Week 2025 is a week-long celebration of innovation, technical growth, and student excellence within the Faculty of Computing, Bayero University Kano. Anchored by two flagship competitions—Py-Kathon 2.0 and Javineer—this initiative charts a developmental journey from foundational programming to professional-grade engineering.

The week is designed not just to test skills, but to ignite passion, foster collaboration, and position our students for real-world impact.

Py-Kathon 2.0

Audience: Level 100 students (all departments)

Format: Individual competition

Duration: 1 day

Focus Areas:

Python problem-solving

Debugging speed rounds

Beginner AI/automation tasks

Quiz bowl on computing fundamentals

Purpose:

To introduce first-year students to the world of programming through a fast-paced, engaging competition that builds confidence and sparks curiosity.

Expected Outcomes:

Early identification of tech talent

Strong coding foundation

Exposure to hackathon culture

Departmental pride and inter-faculty engagement

Javineer

Audience: Level 200 students (faculty-nominated)

Format: 3-day Java hackathon

Duration: Friday to Sunday

Focus Areas:

Full-stack Java development

Algorithmic problem-solving

AI integration

Team collaboration and mentorship

Purpose:

To simulate real-world software engineering challenges, preparing students for industry expectations and showcasing their capabilities to sponsors and alumni.

Expected Outcomes:

Portfolio-worthy projects

Professional readiness

Industry exposure through livestream

Recognition and awards for innovation

Why SWE Week Matters

By aligning Py-Kathon 2.0 and Javineer under the umbrella of SWE Week, the Department of Software Engineering creates a structured talent pipeline:

Level

Focus

Outcome

100

Python fundamentals

Confidence & curiosity

200

Java engineering

Professional readiness

This initiative strengthens our reputation as a hub of innovation, deepens alumni and industry engagement, and cultivates a culture of excellence across all levels.

Signed,

Zainab A.

